00:30:02.610 --> 00:30:03.540
Summits.

00:30:03.540 --> 00:30:06.980
I love talking to
customers there.

00:30:06.980 --> 00:30:10.545
And it's a great opportunity
to come and meet with the dev

00:30:10.545 --> 00:30:14.850
rel, the PMs, the engineers, the
