00:30:23.520 --> 00:30:25.800
The real value is the
hallway conversations

00:30:25.800 --> 00:30:26.710
that you can have.

00:30:26.710 --> 00:30:29.430
And so sign up for--

00:30:29.430 --> 00:30:33.480
