too little, because
I'm not completely

00:31:49.740 --> 00:31:52.180
sure on the exact number.

00:31:52.180 --> 00:31:54.480
So we checked, and he
was actually wrong.

00:31:54.480 --> 00:31:56.100
It was not 28 days.

00:31:56.100 --> 00:31:57.600
It was 22, which--

00:31:57.600 --> 00:31:58.100
[LAUGHTER]

00:31:58.100 --> 00:31:58.310
MARK MANDEL: It's just less.

00:31:58.310 --> 00:31:58.960
[LAUGHTER]

00:31:58.960 --> 00:31:59.760
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah,
which is even faster,

00:31:59.760 --> 00:32:00.900
which is pretty crazy.

00:32:00.900 --> 00:32:01.240
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:32:01.240 --> 00:32:03.365
FRANCESC CAMPOY: In 22
days, they actually migrated

00:32:03.365 --> 00:32:06.677
