00:35:46.540 --> 00:35:48.697
Can we actually access
Cloud Shell from Android?

00:35:48.697 --> 00:35:50.030
Like, what way could we do this?

00:35:50.030 --> 00:35:51.460
And so it's great to
explore this stuff.

00:35:51.460 --> 00:35:53.170
So please continue
